==Description==

The [[Image:Assembly_SelectJointsOfComponent.svg|24px]] [[Assembly_SelectJointsOfComponent|Assembly SelectJointsOfComponent]] tool captures the current assembly state (placement and visibility). Double-clicking the Snapshot object restores the assembly to that state.

==Usage==

# Make sure that an assembly is active.
# Select one or more components.
# There are several ways to invoke the tool:
#* Select the {{MenuCommand|Assembly → [[Image:Assembly_SelectJointsOfComponent.svg|16px]] Select Component Joints}} option from the menu.
#* Right-click in the [[Tree_View|Tree View]] or the [[3D_View|3D View]] and select the {{MenuCommand|Assembly → [[Image:Assembly_SelectJointsOfComponent.svg|16px]] Select Component Joints}} option from the context menu.
# The components are deselected and the related joints are selected in the Tree View.

==Notes==

==Properties==

See also: [[Property_View|Property View]].

This tool doesn't create an object and so no properties are involved.


